        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Disposal, building, door, inner, wood, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Disposal, building, door, inner, wood, to final disposal
The dataset can be applied for a standard inner door (wood) disposal process in Switzerland. ;
UUID: 970ccd25-46a7-4244-8daa-cd29fe06e470
The dataset describes the disposal of a wood-aluminium inner door in a municipal incineration. All the materials (steel parts, aluminium, rubber, plastics, paints and wood) are disposed in a municipal solid waste incineration.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The technology in this dataset represents standard incineration technology in Europe. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Calculation from waste composition 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_970ccd25-46a7-4244-8daa-cd29fe06e470.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
